      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRANT KEEPING (1) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (29.87) at this track. Has a strong winning record here. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Capable of going well again. WINSOME JET (5) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 29.73 beating Fearless Bandit. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Should be in this for a long way. ELSA ABOVE (8) was the fastest winner on the program last time out, running away to score by 7 lengths (29.73) at Nowra. Looks suited and has winning claims again. PUERILE (4) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Hard to beat again.",
